  - NLP annotation
  - LLM evaluation
  - corrosion engineering
abstract: >
  Evaluation harnesses, linguistic NLP annotation, accuracy scoring, and
  empirical research validation analysis for the BIM-Guard platform: a
  BIM compliance-checking system covering IFC geometry extraction, LLM-based
  rule extraction from building codes, and corrosion/clash compliance engines.
  Developed as part of an MSc Final Master Project (MAICEN Group 5).
